# is_straight_flush
# Feature description: Combines is_straight and is_flush to check if the hand is a straight flush (all cards sequentially ranked and of the same suit).
# Usefulness: Captures a higher-order poker rule (combination of straight and flush) that directly aligns with target = 8 (Straight Flush). Simplifies downstream model learning.
df['is_straight_flush'] = df['is_straight'] & df['is_flush']
end

